WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
See you in half an hour

2
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:12,770
Wild boar fat and wolf skin thick

3
00:00:12,930 --> 00:00:13,890
All good things

4
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:19,470
The old price of a wild boar is one dollar and a half

5
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:21,710
Thirty-one wolf skins, two sixty pieces

6
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:24,270
Wolf meat is eighty cents per catty, one hundred and ten catties counts as eighty

7
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:27,920
A total of 520 yuan. How about that?

8
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:35,410
Section Chief Gao

9
00:00:35,690 --> 00:00:36,970
I have something even rarer

10
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:38,530
I don’t know if you have a way to eat it

11
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:40,170
even rarer

12
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:54,040
Tiger meat, you got a tiger.

13
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:57,840
Complete tiger skin and basically complete tiger bones. Things to prick your hands.

14
00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:59,440
Does Section Chief Gao have a safe way?
